        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉測試介面族群輪動 雍智科技周漲29%站回季線",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">AI晶片測試益趨複雜，帶動測試介面重要性攀升，相關族群近來強勢表態，除了漢測(7856-TW)、精測(6510-TW)與創新服務(7828-TW)等陸續上漲，雍智科技(6683-TW)本周突破盤整格局，大漲29.46%，週五終場收在1,670元，創下兩個月來新高價，也收復季線大關。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雍智科技近期受惠AI晶片需求旺盛，8月營收創下歷史新高，達2.33億元，月增1.36%，年增25.74%，累計前8月營收17.8億元，年增29.82%，也同步改寫同期新高。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-cb9d3a80-234a-368e-8652-d5b40333de57-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">展望今年，雍智科技已拿下Google TPU專案，尤其該產品為混針產品，單價相當高，預計今年下半年起可望逐步小量貢獻營收，並預期在明年顯著放量，為因應客戶訂單，雍智科技也在今年積極擴產，擴產幅度達50%。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雍智科技本周自低點反彈，隨後沿五日線上攻，週四一度達1,695元，週五收在1,670元，站回季線大關，以三大法人動向來看，外資與投信皆站買方，分別敲進306張、7張，自營商則逢高調節102張。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c26f79df3f6011b7744b16bb0302f631dead03abee1724b53647b78677b1a415/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F5a74d133a6160ce02cb7b294ce4880ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"雍智ASIC新案下半年起貢獻 今年估擴產5成\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:雍智ASIC新案下半年起貢獻 今年估擴產5成;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6488151?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">雍智ASIC新案下半年起貢獻 今年估擴產5成</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"佈局矽光代工！三星電子使用跟台積電同款測試設備做矽光PIC驗證台\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:佈局矽光代工！三星電子使用跟台積電同款測試設備做矽光PIC驗證台;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6600226?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">佈局矽光代工！三星電子使用跟台積電同款測試設備做矽光PIC驗證台</a></p></div>",
