        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉晶技AI及車載應用挑成長大樑 外資挺進周買逾萬張",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">頻率元件在光通訊的需求強勁推升類股表現強，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/晶技\" rel=\"\">晶技</a> (3042-TW) 在光通訊石英震盪器 (XO) 接單朝向正向發展，且AI及車載應用挑成長大樑，晶技本周獲外資連5日買超，合計總張數達10687張，股價收在184.5元，周漲4.83%，並站上所有均線。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晶技2026年8月營收以14.15億元改寫71個月來新高，也是歷史同期新高，自結單月稅前盈餘2.79億元，月減4.31%，年增39.1%，每股稅前賺0.82元。晶技累計2026年1-8月稅前盈餘17.91億元，年增29.7%，每股稅前盈餘5.27元。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-54b62f0a-2ba1-3fde-ad2a-fde70a3da6b2-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晶技在伺服器、光通訊、光模塊應用的石英震盪器營收比重已攀升到 14-15%，同時，出貨排程已排到 2027 年，在進入傳統旺季第三季，晶技營收將較第二季 的36.99億元有8-10% 的成長，更較去年同期的成長幅度更高。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晶技股價本周量能充沛，收在184.5元，周漲4.83%，並站上所有均線，股價短線支撐在5日線的181.5元。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"晶技日K線圖\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/15f5ceba4fc8b9ac936ef6993ea40868fb21f795b91da5e38e720f10b70e9b71/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F0162523a83ff3fce73df5925915adf26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">晶技日K線圖</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"晶技8月營收14.15億元創同期新高 單月每股稅前賺0.82元\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:晶技8月營收14.15億元創同期新高 單月每股稅前賺0.82元;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6606789?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">晶技8月營收14.15億元創同期新高 單月每股稅前賺0.82元</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"規劃全年資本支出10.78億元 以平鎮爲重心鎖定AI需求\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:規劃全年資本支出10.78億元 以平鎮爲重心鎖定AI需求;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6581635?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">規劃全年資本支出10.78億元 以平鎮爲重心鎖定AI需求</a></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%86%B1%E9%96%80%E8%82%A1-%E6%99%B6%E6%8A%80ai%E5%8F%8A%E8%BB%8A%E8%BC%89%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%91%E6%88%90%E9%95%B7%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%91-%E5%A4%96%E8%B3%87%E6%8C%BA%E9%80%B2%E5%91%A8%E8%B2%B7%E9%80%BE%E8%90%AC%E5%BC%B5-024139026.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-19 11:31:40",
