        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉麗清車用、AI領域雙布局 周漲逾1成回升至2個月來高價",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">車用零組件廠麗清(3346-TW)本周股價反彈12%，回升至2個月來糕點，反映8月合併營收衝上近16個月高點，麗清表示，墨西哥新廠預計自下半年開始量產出貨，而布局AI領域也推進，機器人關節的控制模組產品已陸續進入小量出貨階段。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">麗清指出，華域視覺、海拉、廣州小糸等主要Tier 1客戶對LED車燈模組備貨需求持續增溫，加上特斯拉平價車款、小米SUV等新車款訂單於第三季起陸續進入量產階段，帶動出貨逐步增加。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-bbbc1e64-774d-3baa-b069-85aafeb9950e-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">同時，麗清墨西哥新廠預計自下半年開始量產出貨，提升在北美市場的在地供應能力，而泰國新廠也於下半年推進投入生產行列。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">除車用本業營運逐步成長外，麗清旗下應用於機器人關節控制控制模組產品，已陸續進入小量出貨階段，目前仍持續與客戶推進新專案研發與產品規格優化，拚為中長期營運打造第二成長曲線。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">展望下半年，麗清維持審慎樂觀，隨著新車款訂單陸續進入量產出貨，預期車用LED產品及頭燈控制器出貨表現可望維持穩健，而隨著墨西哥、泰國新廠陸續投入量產，在北美及東南亞供應鏈布局將更趨完善；另一方面，機器人關節控制模組出貨動能持續累積，強化中長期營運韌性與成長動能。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"麗清日K線圖\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ffedfd9d4b6fd7968e7d2c64ded74002de8fca00fa3daac6771550b062a2849d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fbf317118fc962e8634a528b1748a3c2c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">麗清日K線圖</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"read-more-vendor mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><span>更多鉅亨報導</span><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"強茂亮相electronica India 2026 深化印度車用與工業市場布局\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:強茂亮相electronica India 2026 深化印度車用與工業市場布局;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6609203?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">強茂亮相electronica India 2026 深化印度車用與工業市場布局</a><br/>•<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"村田將停產部分消費性及車用MLCC 台廠喜迎轉單\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:村田將停產部分消費性及車用MLCC 台廠喜迎轉單;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6602959?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=RSS&amp;utm_campaign=relate\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">村田將停產部分消費性及車用MLCC 台廠喜迎轉單</a></p></div>",
